# Close whatever is open: B four times returns any dialog, menu or game list
# to the system carousel, which is where every walk starts. On the carousel
# itself B opens a GO TO dialog (GO TO LETTER under the alphabetical systems
# sort, GO TO MANUFACTURER under the manufacturer one, and so on by the SORT
# SYSTEMS setting), so a press that lands there leaves a dialog open instead
# of closing one -- run wake.steps first (its key is one EmulationStation
# ignores, so it never opens anything) and, when the starting state is
# unknown, prefer a fresh EmulationStation: see README.md.
key z
wait 1
key z
wait 1
key z
wait 1
key z
wait 2
